\item plotDegScale: Plots a heatmap of degradation scaling parameters for
refuge density across bleaching years and size bins. Useful for
checking input degradation trajectories.
}

Each plot also has an interactive Plotly version for exploring results.

These tools are especially useful for:
\itemize{
\item Ensuring input data is correctly formatted and interpreted
\item Diagnosing unexpected model behavior due to parameter choices
\item Comparing parameter sets before running simulations
}

For plots of simulation results and time series, see the summary plotting
